      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "UPDATED: the new Secrets API (databricks secrets get-secret / SDK w.secrets.get_secret / REST) RETURNS the value base64-encoded with READ permission, decodable outside a notebook (only dbutils.secrets.get stays redacted). So we CAN export secret values. Scripts run in the PRIMARY (compute + READ available): read values -> encrypt+bundle to the primary S3 bucket -> bidirectional S3 CRR replicates to the other region -> the PROMOTED secondary imports (secrets put) on failover. Symmetric for failback.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "UPDATED: the new Secrets API (databricks secrets get-secret / SDK w.secrets.get_secret / REST) RETURNS the value base64-encoded with READ permission, decodable outside a notebook (only dbutils.secrets.get stays redacted). So we CAN export secret values. Scripts run in the PRIMARY (compute + READ available): read values -> encrypt+bundle to the primary S3 bucket -> bidirectional S3 CRR replicates to the other region -> the PROMOTED secondary imports (secrets put) on failover. Symmetric for failback.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "baseline": 12
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
