      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "READ permission on the scope required (SPN ad-dr-spn).\nMax 128 KB per secret value; max 1000 secrets per scope.\nValues returned base64 -> decode locally. Redaction only affects dbutils in notebooks.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "READ permission on the scope required (SPN ad-dr-spn).\nMax 128 KB per secret value; max 1000 secrets per scope.\nValues returned base64 -> decode locally. Redaction only affects dbutils in notebooks.",
